    "answer_text": "Two ways in which advertising affects issues of equality in a democracy: (i) It only focuses on the lives of the rich and famous and forgets about the issues of poverty, discrimination, and dignity. (ii) Advertising tends to promote a certain lack of respect for the poor as in a democracy, all people are equal and should be able to lead a life of dignity.",
    "answer_latex": null,
    "steps": [],
